AltoStaking::activateContainer()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── given container is deprecated
    │   └── it should revert
    └── given valid container exists and is not deprecated
        └── when container is inactive
            ├── it should activate container
            ├── it should emit ContainerActivated event
            └── when updating max multiplier container id
                ├── given no previous max multiplier container exists
                │   └── it should set new container as max multiplier
                ├── given new container has higher multiplier than current max
                │   └── it should update max multiplier container id and emit event
                ├── given new container has lower multiplier than current max
                │   └── it should not change max multiplier container id
                └── given multiple containers are activated
                    └── it should set container with highest multiplier as max
